// Agreement of leader election (LDFI §5.1.2: "we are able to validate their agreement properties"): in a round, the
// nodes that know a leader know the same one. pre: some node knows the round's leader; post: it does and no node
// knows another. The same shape as Molly's leader specification (R06 §12.4). Blossom golden corpus, re-derived
// (derived = true); see ../../README.md.

disagree(R) :- leader(N1, R, L1), leader(N2, R, L2), L1 != L2;
pre(R) :- leader(N, R, L);
post(R) :- leader(N, R, L), notin disagree(R);
